{"path":"docs/eval-token-comparison.md","ref":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":1,"text":"# Eval tokens and steps: 0.8.0 and main"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":2,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":3,"text":"One full graded run of each tree, same 7 cases, producer `composer-2.5`, graders `grok-4.6`."},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":4,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":5,"text":"The suite total falls from 14.04M tokens to 4.73M (−66%). That drop is the graders. The producer, which is the skill and CLI a user run pays for, stays near 2.7M tokens (−4%). Producer steps fall from 21 to 14 (−33%). Producer tool calls fall from 128 to 106 (−17%)."},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":6,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":7,"text":"`main` is `94cb448`. `package.json` there is still `0.8.0`. This is the tree that would ship in the next release. The previous release is `4167e5f` (`0.8.0`)."},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":8,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":9,"text":"## Method"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":10,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":11,"text":"Both runs are `pnpm eval` with graders on: one producer and two graders (grouping, prose) per case. Tokens are `usage.totalTokens` from the Cursor SDK, which equals input + cache read + output. A step is one assistant message from the SDK `onStep` callback. Tool calls are counted separately. One assistant message can issue many tool calls."},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":12,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":13,"text":"| | 0.8.0 | main |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":14,"text":"| --- | --- | --- |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":15,"text":"| Commit | [`4167e5f`](https://github.com/matemolnar8/comprehende/commit/4167e5f) | [`94cb448`](https://github.com/matemolnar8/comprehende/commit/94cb448) |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":16,"text":"| When | 2026-09-22, local | 2026-09-22, [Actions run 35730203593](https://github.com/matemolnar8/comprehende/actions/runs/35730203593) |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":17,"text":"| Skill tree | `b90033d0755d` | `5007e648d0bc` |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":18,"text":"| `validate` | exit 0 on all 7 | exit 0 on all 7 |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":19,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":20,"text":"0.8.0 did not record steps. This run added the same counter `main` uses (assistant messages and tool calls) and left the prompt, skill, CLI, and graders as they were in that release."},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":21,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":22,"text":"Two harness differences sit in these numbers:"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":23,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":24,"text":"- The 0.8.0 producer prompt says the CLI named in the skill is the local build. The `main` prompt names `node <abs>/dist/cli/main.js` and tells the agent that command is already built. Any CLI search that sentence causes sits in the 0.8.0 producer totals."},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":25,"text":"- Graders on `main` get the grading packet inline and are told to start from it. 0.8.0 graders do not. Grader tokens are eval cost. They are not part of the published package."},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":26,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":27,"text":"The skill and CLI also differ. 0.8.0 tells the agent to run `index`, read the JSON Schema, and write `review.json` across separate commands. `main` writes a covering skeleton with `review`, batches the shell commands, uses `references/example.md` for the shape, and writes `review.json` once. Lockfiles have no hunk refs."},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":28,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":29,"text":"`validate` passed on every case in both runs. The 0.8.0 run missed deterministic expects in its own case files (`why`, `parts`, `together` on several cases). The `main` run passed its expects. Those expects were edited after 0.8.0. Prose lint does not fail the run."},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":30,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":31,"text":"## Suite"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":32,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":33,"text":"| | 0.8.0 | main | Change |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":34,"text":"| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":35,"text":"| Tokens | 14,039,185 | 4,730,610 | −66.3% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":36,"text":"| Producer tokens | 2,776,563 | 2,653,514 | −4.4% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":37,"text":"| Producer steps | 21 | 14 | −33.3% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":38,"text":"| Producer tool calls | 128 | 106 | −17.2% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":39,"text":"| Grader tokens | 11,262,622 | 2,077,096 | −81.6% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":40,"text":"| Grader steps | 71 | 27 | −62.0% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":41,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":42,"text":"Producer token split:"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":43,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":44,"text":"| | 0.8.0 | main | Change |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":45,"text":"| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":46,"text":"| Input | 1,480,766 | 1,458,125 | −1.5% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":47,"text":"| Cache read | 1,253,248 | 1,153,248 | −8.0% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":48,"text":"| Output | 42,549 | 42,141 | −1.0% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":49,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":50,"text":"Output stays about 1.5% of producer tokens. Almost all of the producer cost is context sent again on the next call."},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":51,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":52,"text":"## Per case"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":53,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":54,"text":"Producer. This is the user-facing cost."},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":55,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":56,"text":"| Case | 0.8.0 tokens | Steps | Tools | main tokens | Steps | Tools | Tokens |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":57,"text":"| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":58,"text":"| comprehende-39 | 294,843 | 2 | 15 | 198,510 | 2 | 11 | −32.7% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":59,"text":"| comprehende-47 | 716,521 | 5 | 27 | 758,443 | 2 | 21 | +5.9% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":60,"text":"| comprehende-50 | 301,937 | 2 | 19 | 162,916 | 2 | 11 | −46.0% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":61,"text":"| comprehende-57 | 382,500 | 2 | 17 | 545,785 | 2 | 18 | +42.7% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":62,"text":"| comprehende-59 | 405,862 | 5 | 18 | 402,366 | 2 | 18 | −0.9% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":63,"text":"| comprehende-67 | 427,127 | 2 | 18 | 394,048 | 2 | 16 | −7.7% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":64,"text":"| vitadeck-24 | 247,773 | 3 | 14 | 191,446 | 2 | 11 | −22.7% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":65,"text":"| Total | 2,776,563 | 21 | 128 | 2,653,514 | 14 | 106 | −4.4% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":66,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":67,"text":"Steps fall on the three cases that were above 2 (comprehende-47, comprehende-59, vitadeck-24). The other four stay at 2. Token change per case runs from −46% to +43%. The swings cancel in the total."},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":68,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":69,"text":"Graders, per case. Grouping plus prose."},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":70,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":71,"text":"| Case | 0.8.0 tokens | Steps | main tokens | Steps | Tokens |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":72,"text":"| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":73,"text":"| comprehende-39 | 1,821,411 | 9 | 189,012 | 4 | −89.6% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":74,"text":"| comprehende-47 | 1,269,419 | 10 | 541,915 | 4 | −57.3% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":75,"text":"| comprehende-50 | 999,159 | 10 | 53,200 | 3 | −94.7% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":76,"text":"| comprehende-57 | 1,092,974 | 9 | 577,282 | 4 | −47.2% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":77,"text":"| comprehende-59 | 1,516,519 | 10 | 236,605 | 4 | −84.4% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":78,"text":"| comprehende-67 | 2,396,524 | 10 | 137,877 | 3 | −94.2% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":79,"text":"| vitadeck-24 | 2,166,616 | 13 | 341,205 | 5 | −84.3% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":80,"text":"| Total | 11,262,622 | 71 | 2,077,096 | 27 | −81.6% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":81,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":82,"text":"Suite total per case (producer + graders):"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":83,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":84,"text":"| Case | 0.8.0 | main | Change |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":85,"text":"| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":86,"text":"| comprehende-39 | 2,116,254 | 387,522 | −81.7% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":87,"text":"| comprehende-47 | 1,985,940 | 1,300,358 | −34.5% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":88,"text":"| comprehende-50 | 1,301,096 | 216,116 | −83.4% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":89,"text":"| comprehende-57 | 1,475,474 | 1,123,067 | −23.9% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":90,"text":"| comprehende-59 | 1,922,381 | 638,971 | −66.8% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":91,"text":"| comprehende-67 | 2,823,651 | 531,925 | −81.2% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":92,"text":"| vitadeck-24 | 2,414,389 | 532,651 | −77.9% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":93,"text":"| Total | 14,039,185 | 4,730,610 | −66.3% |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":94,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":95,"text":"## How to read one run"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":96,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":97,"text":"`composer-2.5` moves a lot between runs of the same skill. The [token efficiency note](./token-efficiency.md) measured 1.6× to 3× on a single case. Read the suite producer total as the signal, and the per-case token column as a range."},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":98,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":99,"text":"Other full-suite producer totals on `main` since the covering-skeleton work, one run each, same model. Steps exist only where the harness recorded them. These commits are all after 0.8.0 and before or at `94cb448`. They show the band a single run already occupies."},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":100,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":101,"text":"| Run | Commit | Producer tokens | Producer steps | Notes |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":102,"text":"| --- | --- | ---: | ---: | --- |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":103,"text":"| 0.8.0, this report | `4167e5f` | 2,776,563 | 21 | release skill and CLI |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":104,"text":"| [35552579760](https://github.com/matemolnar8/comprehende/actions/runs/35552579760) | `da6ebeb` | 2,551,962 | | checks failed on 5 cases |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":105,"text":"| [35580729835](https://github.com/matemolnar8/comprehende/actions/runs/35580729835) | `18bd5cb` | 2,687,144 | | passed |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":106,"text":"| [35647787903](https://github.com/matemolnar8/comprehende/actions/runs/35647787903) | `a05aef8` | 3,287,719 | | passed, last run before the batched skill |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":107,"text":"| [35712133164](https://github.com/matemolnar8/comprehende/actions/runs/35712133164) | `d796524` | 2,865,944 | 16 | same skill tree as `main`, one size expect missed |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":108,"text":"| [35730203593](https://github.com/matemolnar8/comprehende/actions/runs/35730203593) | `94cb448` | 2,653,514 | 14 | this report's `main` |"},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":109,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":110,"text":"The `main` producer total (2.65M) sits inside that band (2.55M to 3.29M). The step drop (21, then 16 on the same skill as `main`, then 14) is the stable change. A second `main` run could move the token total by as much as the cases above already do."},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":111,"text":""},{"sha":"a9cb0a1366829560e85b08c80d24f0dcf2465f97","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790101000,"line":112,"text":"The [token efficiency note](./token-efficiency.md) used a separate stream script and reported a 4.51M producer mean. That series is a different counter. This report uses the eval harness on both sides."}]}
